<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>楽天→Yahoo!ショッピング 商品移行 (RYS)</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar navbar-dark bg-primary px-3">
    <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="/apps/rakuten-yahoo-sync/">楽天→Yahoo!ショッピング 商品移行</a>
    <div class="ms-auto d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
      <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">Phase <%= phase %></span>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">ポータルに戻る</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container py-4">
    <div class="alert <%= status.healthy ? 'alert-success' : 'alert-danger' %>">
      <strong><%= status.healthy ? '✅ env 設定 OK' : '⚠️ 必須 env 不足' %></strong>
      <% if (!status.healthy) { %>
        <div class="mt-2">未設定: <code><%= status.missing_required.join(', ') %></code></div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="mt-2 small">
        実 publish: <strong><%= status.publish_enabled ? 'ON (RYS_PUBLISH_ENABLED=1)' : 'OFF (default、 dry-run only)' %></strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><strong>必須 env (REQUIRED)</strong></div>
      <table class="table table-sm mb-0">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Key</th>
            <th>用途</th>
            <th>Status</th>
            <th>値 / 長さ</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% for (const r of status.required) { %>
            <tr class="<%= r.set ? '' : 'table-danger' %>">
              <td><code><%= r.key %></code></td>
              <td><%= r.purpose %></td>
              <td><%= r.set ? '✅ set' : '❌ unset' %></td>
              <td>
                <% if (!r.set) { %>—<% } else if (r.value !== undefined) { %>
                  <code><%= r.value %></code>
                <% } else { %>
                  <small class="text-muted">length=<%= r.length %></small>
                <% } %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% } %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><strong>任意 env (OPTIONAL)</strong></div>
      <table class="table table-sm mb-0">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Key</th>
            <th>用途</th>
            <th>Status</th>
            <th>値 / 長さ</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% for (const o of status.optional) { %>
            <tr>
              <td><code><%= o.key %></code></td>
              <td><%= o.purpose %></td>
              <td><%= o.set ? '✅ set' : '— unset' %></td>
              <td>
                <% if (!o.set) { %>—<% } else if (o.value !== undefined) { %>
                  <code><%= o.value %></code>
                <% } else { %>
                  <small class="text-muted">length=<%= o.length %></small>
                <% } %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% } %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header"><strong>次のステップ (Phase E-2 以降)</strong></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li><strong>E-1 (現在)</strong>: skeleton + env 確認画面 ← イマココ</li>
          <li><strong>E-2</strong>: Notion 商品マスター sync (専用 RYS DB に 271 件取込)</li>
          <li><strong>E-3</strong>: delivery / variation / readiness resolver 移植</li>
          <li><strong>E-4</strong>: field-mapper + buildYahooEditItemFields + dry-run endpoint</li>
          <li><strong>E-5</strong>: 実 publish (idempotency + lease、 RYS_PUBLISH_ENABLED=1 で初稼働)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3 small text-muted">
      API: <a href="/apps/rakuten-yahoo-sync/api/health"><code>GET /apps/rakuten-yahoo-sync/api/health</code></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
